  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  featureName: Troposphere
  informationText: "<align=left><b>Height Range:</b> 0 \u2013 12 km\r\n<b>Key Features:</b>
    Contains most atmospheric gases; weather phenomena like clouds, rain, and storms
    occur here. This layer supports most forms of terrestrial life.\r\n<b>Temperature
    Trend:</b> Decreases with altitude (15\xB0C to -56\xB0C)\r\n<b>Elements:</b>
    Clouds, birds, aircraft, hot air balloons, drones, paragliders, plants."
